!.vscode/extensions.json

# mdx results
app/mdx/*.xml

# Committed @nativescript/localize hook registration (this project uses
# gjsify-managed node_modules, so `npm install` never injects these hooks;
# without them `ns prepare` won't regenerate res/values-*/strings.xml).
!hooks/
!hooks/before-checkForChanges/
!hooks/before-checkForChanges/nativescript-localize.js
!hooks/before-watchPatterns/
!hooks/before-watchPatterns/nativescript-localize.js
